Package: nativedev
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, pkexec
Description: graphical control plane for a native PHP development stack
 NativeDev provides a GTK4 interface for native PHP, Nginx, Node/NVM,
 databases, cache services, local .test DNS and HTTPS development tooling.
